Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_1::
	@ ShinyGold: overlapping data duplicated from 0x08870B46
	.string "Hm? You know BILL? He’s my\n"
	.string "grandson.\p"
	.string "He’s in JOHTO. He does something\n"
	.string "with PCs, so I’m house-sitting.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_2::
	.string "Thanks for showing me so many cute\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I really enjoyed myself. I’m glad\n"
	.string "I’ve lived such a long life.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_4::
	.string "If you have that POKéMON, may I see\n"
	.string "it, please?$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_5::
	.string "You don’t have it? That’s too bad...$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_8::
	.string "Do you know that hugely popular\n"
	.string "POKéMON?\p"
	.string "The POKéMON that has a yellow body\n"
	.string "and red cheeks.\p"
	.string "I would love to see what it looks\n"
	.string "like before it evolves.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_9::
	.string "BILL told me about a POKéMON that is\n"
	.string "very loyal to its trainer.\p"
	.string "It’s supposed to ROAR well.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_10::
	.string "Do you know of a sea POKéMON that\n"
	.string "has a red sphere in its body?\p"
	.string "You know, the one that’s shaped like\n"
	.string "a star?\p"
	.string "I heard that it appears at night.\p"
	.string "I would surely like to see it.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_11::
	.string "Ah, my grandson mentioned a round,\n"
	.string "green POKéMON that has leaves\l"
	.string "growing on its head.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_12::
	.string "My grandson BILL told me about a\n"
	.string "POKéMON that has a long tongue.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_13::
	.string "You will show me?\n"
	.string "How good of you!\p"
	.string "Hmmm...$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_15::
	.string "Isn’t it cute!\n"
	.string "That’s so kind of you.\p"
	.string "Thanks!\p"
	.string "This is a token of my appreciation.$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_18::
	.string "Ah, so that is PICHU?$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_19::
	.string "Ah, so that is GROWLITHE?$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_20::
	.string "Ah, so that is STARYU?$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_21::
	.string "Ah, so that is ODDISH?$"

Route25_Interior1_Text_OldMan22_22::
	.string "Ah, so that is LICKITUNG?$"
